From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 16:09:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 176/206] feat: resurrect Light Propagation Volumes as cheap
 dynamic GI (r_LPV)

Single cascade sun-only LPV running as CLPVStage in the standard graphics
pipeline, toggled globally by r_LPV. Sun RSM reuses the existing
ePass_DirectionalLightRSM infrastructure (SVOGI keeps priority), injection
scatters VPLs into a fixed point accumulator, 6-neighbour propagation with
temporal accumulation, additive combine in tiled shading (nIntegrMode 3).

Also ports VS2022 compatibility fixes for RC/oculus/EditorCommon from the
main checkout and adds r_LPVDebug staged debugging modes.

